      },
      "layout_tag": "paragraph",
      "confidence": 0.9099826812744141,
      "reading_order": 12,
      "text": "The majority of the FTA in Varanasi/ Sarnath is from the US, Europe and Japan, and there is a growing\nnumber of tourists from South Asia and Southeast Asian countries such as Sri Lanka, China and Korea."
    },
    {
      "block_id": "20260726_ee793a2d-3b21-491e-acf2-0bffa5f48f31_8_block_012",
      "coordinates": {
        "x1": 284.0,
        "y1": 2388.0,
        "x2": 2196.0,
        "y2": 2581.0
      },
      "layout_tag": "paragraph",
      "confidence": 0.9372023940086365,
      "reading_order": 13,
      "text": "The DTA is concentrated between September and November; on the other hand, the FTA is concentrated\nbetween January and March. The overall peak season falls between October and March, and the other\nmonths are the lean season."
    },
